      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-01-22T16:53:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't call Plague Rat \"Ongoing-heavy.\"&nbsp; He has a couple other than Infection, but you're not meant to destroy Infection through normal Ongoing-destroying means.</p>\n<p>Iron Legacy is another story, but games against him are so short that there's no real difference between one-shots and ongoings.&nbsp; In fact, I'd generally rather have one-shots for the action economy.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:55.189Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
