      "created_at": "2021-01-25T06:05:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You've already stated that you don't have Oblivaeon, so he isn't available to you, but Luminary has a power, albeit on a card that destroys itself, that can take out almost anything - ongoings, environment cards, minions, citizens, anything destructible except villain character cards, up to half as many of them as you have cards in your discard pile. It can't be used until there are 15 cards in the discard pile, but it's a game changer when you can make it work!</p>",
